OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see further showers. Then
OL,7,Fbecoming drier overnight with clear
OL,8,Fperiods but a few showers continuing
OL,9,Facross the north. Fresh northwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds easing down.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA few showers at first
OL,13,Facross northern Aberdeenshire
OL,14,Fotherwise dry with bright spells.
OL,15,FLighter winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,18,Ffor most of Thursday but rain
OL,19,Fspreading east by evening. Dry with
OL,20,Fbright spells on Friday. Rain likely
OL,21,Fon Saturday.
